1.8.1: super8ify names reels after their camera

The output default was hardcoded to _super8.mp4 regardless of CAMERA; a
polavision reel now lands as INPUT_polavision.mp4. Also guards against
the misplaced-environment-variable mistake: an output name containing
'=' (the fingerprint of CAMERA=... typed after the command) is refused
with the corrected invocation shown.
